        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ledger): add immutable action history core",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add immutable, create-only JSONL action shards with deterministic replay and conflict detection\n- restrict identity inputs to strict canonical JSON with safe integers only; large identifiers must be strings\n- require explicit outcome-independent idempotency identities for mutations\n- bind repository and SHA into replay-stable producer identities and shard paths\n- preserve source timestamps while deterministically sorting causal children after parents\n- keep CrabFleet projection failures durable without logging response bodies\n\n## Independent Review Hardening\n\n- snapshot every parent directory by device and inode immediately around open, write, hard-link, and cleanup mutations\n- verify opened descriptors and linked files still identify the expected path; parent swaps fail closed before reporting success\n- reject whitespace-delimited and mixed-case bearer/API credentials plus case-insensitive private paths\n- reject credential identity aliases including `authToken`, `githubToken`, `refresh_token`, and `cloudflareApiToken`\n- reject unsafe JavaScript integers before identity hashing\n- align schema and runtime rejection for private IPv6, dot-only paths, UNC/backslash paths, mixed-case private paths, credential-bearing paths, and unsafe integers\n\n## Design\n\n- local writers spool one immutable event file per transition\n- workflow finalization batches events into one digest-addressed shard per full producer identity\n- shard paths are `ledger/v1/events/YYYY/MM/DD/<producer-repo>/<producer>/<run-attempt-job-digest>.jsonl`\n- shard partitions derive only from immutable workflow metadata or an explicit stable date\n- source timestamps remain evidence; causal topology resolves ordering conflicts\n- mutable comments, dashboards, sessions, command ledgers, and evidence graphs remain projections\n\n## Validation\n\n- `pnpm --config.verify-deps-before-run=false run build`\n- focused type-aware `oxlint`\n- `node --test test/action-ledger.test.ts test/action-ledger-runtime.test.ts` (`51/51`)\n- `pnpm --config.verify-deps-before-run=false run check`\n  - unit tests: `973/973`\n  - repair tests: `723/723`\n  - coverage, lint, TypeScript, active-surface, limits, and formatting passed\n- adversarial parent swap-and-restore regression\n- full-event schema validation differentials for every cited parity gap\n\n## Follow-ups\n\n- instrument review/apply and sweep publication\n- instrument command, repair, notification, and operational workflows\n- bind review and closure evidence to Gitcrawl snapshots and Cloudflare archive queries\n- add deterministic projection rebuilds and retention compaction",
